# Publish only what the running customer/CRM application needs.
# Mirrors the repository-root .vercelignore (owner-approved O3 exclusion, 2026-10-08) and adds the
# server-side / archive files that exist in this deployable set. Every excluded path was checked
# against the computed client-required module graph (index.html + crm.html + transitive imports):
# none of the 27 required frontend modules, /data/*.json fixtures, /assets/**, /api/liff-config.js
# or _redirects is excluded.
